				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]姫『せ　せっかく
ここまで　来たのに……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
